<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  RM_ContagionBulloos.xml — the blistered bulloo and the zhool, the Contagion's two floating gas-sac
  creatures. Phase 0 P3 (design/RimMandrake/biome_sprint_kickoff_2026-10-15.md §0.5.3 item 2): donor-code
  creatures ported as our own plain XML. Invented creatures, no Star Wars IP: RM_ tier.
  Ported from Alpha Animals (sarg.alphaanimals, 1.6/Defs/ThingDefs_Races/Races_InfectedAerofleet.xml and
  Races_OcularJelly.xml). Labels and descriptions are ours, the words the campaign's Contagion_Rename.xml
  patches onto the donor defs. Comfy bands are the live values AnimalTolerances_Ashkarr.xml pins on the
  donor defs. Bodies: Defs/Bodies/RM_BullooBodies.xml.

  BLISTERED BULLOO (RM_InfectedAerofleet). Owner pick "rebuild" (donor_code_creatures_sheet_2026-10-09).
    REPOINTED to ours: the acid death burst -> RimMandrake.EnvironmentalHazards.DeathActionProperties_ScaledExplosion
      (the values the retired donor death-burst patch (deleted 2026-10-15) set).
  ZHOOL (RM_OcularJelly). Owner pick "rebuild" (twitching limbs).
    PLAIN GRAPHIC for now: the donor drew four twitching tentacle sprites with its own SpasticScaled render
    tree (donor code). Every picture of ours bakes the tentacles into one whole-body sprite, so the creature
    gets the vanilla animal render tree and one fixed graphic per life stage. Rebuilding the twitch needs new
    body-only and limb art: the owner's call, Transient/phase0_p3_questions.md Q1.
    REBUILT in our code: the reddish haze the description names (donor gas AA_OcularGas, Alpha Animals code) is
    RimMandrake.Contagion.CompZhoolHaze (owner, 2026-10-15, phase0_p3_questions.md Q2 "A"): tinted fleck haze;
    plants in it turn into the Contagion's ocular-forest flora, only on our biomes. Mod Settings: "The zhool's red haze".
  BOTH:
    KEPT, VEF-guarded (a framework we keep): Floating (drifts, ignores terrain), asexual fission.
    Floating is kept rather than real flight: these drift permanently at canopy height, which the
    MaxFlightTime stat (bursts of flight from the ground) does not express.
    SWAPPED: body AA_JellyfishBody / AA_OcularJellyBody -> RM_BullooBody / RM_ZhoolBody; leather
      AA_Leather_Aerofleet -> Leather_Light; meat AA_OcularJellyMeat -> useMeatFrom Pig; zhool sounds
      AA_OcularJelly_* -> Anomaly's fingerspike; dessicated art (donor) -> vanilla iguana.
    DROPPED: the donor's venomous-barb ability AA_RedPoisonBolt (donor ability, named in neither of our
      descriptions); the blistered bulloo's Blue Gel product (donor item; its description names none);
      the VEF ControlledDetonation PawnKind ability and Odyssey trainables (donor-specific); donor
      wildBiomes; the VEF AnimalStatExtension info-card rows.
  ART: installed through the art ledger 2026-10-15 (owner: "accept all the art you showed me"): zhool = gapall_AA_OcularJelly_v1,
    blistered bulloo = enact_d3c59886_infectedaerofleet_v1; texPaths are ours, roster rows carry no donor guard.
-->
<Defs>

  <!-- ===================== BLISTERED BULLOO ===================== -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_InfectedAerofleet</defName>
    <label>blistered bulloo</label>
    <description>An unfortunate visitor. A bulloo is nothing but a floating ball of gas: no feet, no limbs worth the name, only a swollen sac and a fringe of trailing feelers beneath it. This one drifted into the Contagion on the wind and caught what lives there. The sickness has worked into its skin, which is now a blistered, red-veined mass, and it fills the sac with spore in place of the clean gas its kin ride on. It still drifts where the air takes it and bumps into whatever is in the way. Burst one and the spore goes with it.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>2.84</MoveSpeed>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>-63.2</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>67.5</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <MarketValue>180</MarketValue>
      <MeatAmount>0</MeatAmount>
      <Wildness>0.6</Wildness>
    </statBases>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <capacities>
          <li>Bite</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>7</power>
        <cooldownTime>2.5</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>Teeth</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>feelers</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Blunt</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>4</power>
        <cooldownTime>1.65</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>Arms</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
        <chanceFactor>0.2</chanceFactor>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <comps>
      <li Class="VEF.AnimalBehaviours.CompProperties_AsexualReproduction" MayRequire="OskarPotocki.VanillaFactionsExpanded.Core">
        <reproductionIntervalDays>9</reproductionIntervalDays>
        <customString>Asexual fission in: </customString>
      </li>
      <li Class="VEF.AnimalBehaviours.CompProperties_Floating" MayRequire="OskarPotocki.VanillaFactionsExpanded.Core" />
    </comps>
    <race>
      <deathAction Class="RimMandrake.EnvironmentalHazards.DeathActionProperties_ScaledExplosion">
        <flatRadius>1.5</flatRadius>
        <damageDef>AcidBurn</damageDef>
        <damageAmount>8</damageAmount>
        <postExplosionFilth>Filth_SpentAcid</postExplosionFilth>
        <postExplosionFilthChance>0.3</postExplosionFilthChance>
      </deathAction>
      <executionRange>2</executionRange>
      <herdAnimal>true</herdAnimal>
      <body>RM_BullooBody</body>
      <baseBodySize>0.2</baseBodySize>
      <baseHealthScale>0.4</baseHealthScale>
      <baseHungerRate>0.02</baseHungerRate>
      <hasGenders>false</hasGenders>
      <foodType>VegetarianRoughAnimal</foodType>
      <leatherDef>Leather_Light</leatherDef>
      <canBePredatorPrey>false</canBePredatorPrey>
      <trainability>None</trainability>
      <useMeatFrom>Pig</useMeatFrom>
      <lifeExpectancy>9</lifeExpectancy>
      <lifeStageAges>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalBaby</def>
          <minAge>0</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalJuvenile</def>
          <minAge>0.1</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalAdult</def>
          <minAge>0.2222</minAge>
          <soundWounded>Pawn_Rodent_Wounded</soundWounded>
          <soundDeath>Pawn_Rodent_Death</soundDeath>
          <soundCall>Pawn_Rodent_Call</soundCall>
          <soundAngry>Pawn_Rodent_Angry</soundAngry>
        </li>
      </lifeStageAges>
      <soundMeleeHitPawn>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_HitPawn</soundMeleeHitPawn>
      <soundMeleeHitBuilding>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_HitBuilding</soundMeleeHitBuilding>
      <soundMeleeMiss>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_Miss</soundMeleeMiss>
    </race>
    <tradeTags>
      <li>AnimalExotic</li>
    </tradeTags>
  </ThingDef>

  <PawnKindDef ParentName="AnimalKindBase">
    <defName>RM_InfectedAerofleet</defName>
    <label>blistered bulloo</label>
    <race>RM_InfectedAerofleet</race>
    <combatPower>35</combatPower>
    <wildGroupSize>
      <min>1</min>
      <max>7</max>
    </wildGroupSize>
    <lifeStages>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RM_InfectedAerofleet/RM_InfectedAerofleet</texPath>
          <drawSize>0.5</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
        <dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/Iguana/Dessicated_Iguana</texPath>
          <drawSize>0.5</drawSize>
        </dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
      </li>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RM_InfectedAerofleet/RM_InfectedAerofleet</texPath>
          <drawSize>0.75</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
        <dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/Iguana/Dessicated_Iguana</texPath>
          <drawSize>0.75</drawSize>
        </dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
      </li>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RM_InfectedAerofleet/RM_InfectedAerofleet</texPath>
          <drawSize>0.85</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
        <dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/Iguana/Dessicated_Iguana</texPath>
          <drawSize>0.85</drawSize>
        </dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
      </li>
    </lifeStages>
  </PawnKindDef>

  <!-- ===================== ZHOOL ===================== -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_OcularJelly</defName>
    <label>zhool</label>
    <description>A gas-filled, veined bell trailing loose tendrils through the canopy. It exhales a reddish haze that turns nearby plants into growths of the same strange flesh. When zhools sink and settle, a Burn is close.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>2</MoveSpeed>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>-35</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>67.5</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <MarketValue>250</MarketValue>
      <Wildness>0.8</Wildness>
    </statBases>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <capacities>
          <li>Bite</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>7</power>
        <cooldownTime>1.1</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>Teeth</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>feelers</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Blunt</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>4</power>
        <cooldownTime>1.2</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>Arms</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <comps>
      <li Class="VEF.AnimalBehaviours.CompProperties_AsexualReproduction" MayRequire="OskarPotocki.VanillaFactionsExpanded.Core">
        <reproductionIntervalDays>15</reproductionIntervalDays>
        <customString>Asexual fission in: </customString>
      </li>
      <li Class="VEF.AnimalBehaviours.CompProperties_Floating" MayRequire="OskarPotocki.VanillaFactionsExpanded.Core" />
      <li Class="RimMandrake.Contagion.CompProperties_ZhoolHaze">
        <!-- the Contagion's ocular-forest flora (CONTAGION_FLORA_PORT_1): tree, ground cover, everything else -->
        <treeResult>RM_HalfmadeTree</treeResult>
        <groundCoverResult>RM_Lashgrass</groundCoverResult>
        <shrubResult>RM_Bleedleaf</shrubResult>
        <immunePlants>
          <li>RM_Meatvine</li>
          <li>RM_Toothmoss</li>
          <li>RM_Wombpod</li>
          <li>RM_Eyebark</li>
          <li>RM_Gorestalk</li>
          <li>RM_Rattlegrope</li>
          <li>RM_Sapblister</li>
          <li>RM_BloodyFist</li>
          <li>RM_HalfmadeTreeBlighted</li>
        </immunePlants>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <race>
      <herdAnimal>true</herdAnimal>
      <body>RM_ZhoolBody</body>
      <baseBodySize>0.5</baseBodySize>
      <baseHealthScale>1</baseHealthScale>
      <baseHungerRate>0.01</baseHungerRate>
      <hasGenders>false</hasGenders>
      <foodType>VegetarianRoughAnimal</foodType>
      <leatherDef>Leather_Light</leatherDef>
      <useMeatFrom>Pig</useMeatFrom>
      <trainability>Intermediate</trainability>
      <lifeExpectancy>4</lifeExpectancy>
      <lifeStageAges>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalBaby</def>
          <minAge>0</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalJuvenile</def>
          <minAge>0.1</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalAdult</def>
          <minAge>0.2222</minAge>
          <soundWounded>Pawn_Fleshbeast_Fingerspike_Wounded</soundWounded>
          <soundDeath>Pawn_Fleshbeast_Fingerspike_Death</soundDeath>
          <soundCall>Pawn_Fleshbeast_Fingerspike_Call</soundCall>
          <soundAngry>Pawn_Fleshbeast_Fingerspike_Call</soundAngry>
        </li>
      </lifeStageAges>
      <soundMeleeHitPawn>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_HitPawn</soundMeleeHitPawn>
      <soundMeleeHitBuilding>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_HitBuilding</soundMeleeHitBuilding>
      <soundMeleeMiss>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_Miss</soundMeleeMiss>
    </race>
    <tradeTags>
      <li>AnimalExotic</li>
    </tradeTags>
  </ThingDef>

  <PawnKindDef ParentName="AnimalKindBase">
    <defName>RM_OcularJelly</defName>
    <label>zhool</label>
    <race>RM_OcularJelly</race>
    <combatPower>35</combatPower>
    <canArriveManhunter>false</canArriveManhunter>
    <lifeStages>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RM_OcularJelly/RM_OcularJelly</texPath>
          <drawSize>0.5</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
        <dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/Iguana/Dessicated_Iguana</texPath>
          <drawSize>0.5</drawSize>
        </dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
      </li>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RM_OcularJelly/RM_OcularJelly</texPath>
          <drawSize>1.25</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
        <dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/Iguana/Dessicated_Iguana</texPath>
          <drawSize>1.25</drawSize>
        </dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
      </li>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RM_OcularJelly/RM_OcularJelly</texPath>
          <drawSize>1.75</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
        <dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/Iguana/Dessicated_Iguana</texPath>
          <drawSize>1.75</drawSize>
        </dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
      </li>
    </lifeStages>
  </PawnKindDef>

</Defs>
